      101.49,
      388.09,
      486.19,
      399.16
    ],
    "text": "CALLING APPLICATIONS FOR THE APPOINTMENT OF PRESIDENT\u2019S COUNSEL",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      412.09,
      539.89,
      447.16
    ],
    "text": "APPLICATIONS are called for the appointment of President\u2019s Counsel in terms of the Article 33(2)(e) of the Constitution.The Attorneys-at-Law who have reached eminence in the legal profession and maintained high standards of conduct andprofessional rectitude are eligible to apply for the above appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      460.09,
      539.95,
      507.16
    ],
    "text": "Accordingly, the Attorneys-at-Law who satisfy the eligibility criteria specified in the guidelines published in theGazette Extraordinary No. 2147/37 dated 29.10.2019 should send the duly completed applications on the from givenbelow under registered cover to \u201cSecretary to the President, Presidential Secretariat, Colombo 01\u201d on or before07.11.2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      520.09,
      539.92,
      543.16
    ],
    "text": "The legend \u201cAppointment of President\u2019s Counsel\u201d should be clearly written on the top left corner of the envelopecontaining the applications",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      556.09,
      540.09,
      579.16
    ],
    "text": "Any applications received after the said date will not be entertained and the Presidential Secretariat will not beheld responsible for any misplaced or delayed applications.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      592.09,
      353.23,
      603.16
    ],
    "text": "Applications can be downloaded via www.presidentsoffice.gov.lk.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
